-- ACTOR ------------------- errors/pid_serialize_1.march

`Hello` cannot derive Json, because its field `from` holds a `Pid`. [pid_serialize]
A local pid names an actor on this node only; on another node it would name whatever runs in that slot there.

19 |   derive Json for Hello
              ^^^^

    Carry a `GlobalPid.Pid` (node id, local pid, creation) in `Hello` instead; it is a plain record and derives Json.

    `from` holds the pid:

18 |   type Hello = { from : Pid(Counter), n : Int }
                      ^^^^


